# LedgerMind API ke namoone (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client / Rider).
# 1) "Login" wali request chalayein.
# 2) Jawab ka "token" neeche @token me paste karein (15 minute chalta hai; phir dobara login).
# Asal password yahan commit na karein.
# "http" launch profile: @host = http://localhost:5194 (neeche wala).
# "https" launch profile: @host = https://localhost:7210 rakhein. Warna UseHttpsRedirection 307 deta hai
# aur kuch REST clients redirect par Authorization header gira dete hain (phir 401).

@host = http://localhost:5194
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Health (public): app + database ka haal (200 Healthy / 503 Unhealthy)
GET {{host}}/api/Health
Accept: application/json

### Login (token aur refreshToken milta hai)
POST {{host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ledgermind.local",
  "password": "your-password-here"
}

### Login user ki maloomat aur roles
GET {{host}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Invoices ki list
GET {{host}}/api/Invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Approval ke intezar me invoices aur expenses (Admin / FinanceManager)
GET {{host}}/api/Approvals/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Reports summary (Admin / FinanceManager)
GET {{host}}/api/Reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Chatbot se sawal
POST {{host}}/api/Chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "message": "Show my pending tasks",
  "history": []
}

### Audit log, filters ke saath (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/Audit?entityType=Invoice&take=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Invoice reminder emails ke logs (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/Email/logs?type=InvoiceReminder&take=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Overdue check foran chalayein (Admin): 202 { message, jobId }
POST {{host}}/api/Jobs/run-overdue-check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Purane refresh tokens ki safai foran chalayein (Admin): 202 { message, jobId }
POST {{host}}/api/Jobs/run-token-cleanup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
